    <h1 class="fw-bold mb-4">About CPT Journal</h1>
    <p class="lead">A travel blog dedicated to Cape Town — the beaches, mountains, wine regions, and everything in between.</p>
    <p>CPT Journal was created to share genuine stories, local tips, and honest recommendations for anyone looking to explore the Western Cape. From Boulders Beach penguins to Franschhoek wine farms, each post is written with a real traveller's eye.</p>
